                <run>
There is an extra cleaning logic applied to the Test Order Sent events as there are excessive Test Order Success shown event found in the tracking. It is possible that fewer Test Order Sent events are found due to tracking issue, then the current logic would compare both numbers of Test Order Sent and Success shown and assume the higher one is the number of Sent events. To be fixed in VEO-1112.</run>
